**/.gradle/
**/build/
**/.kotlin/
**/.idea/
**/node_modules/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Artefacts de compilation
**/*.apk
**/*.aab
**/*.msi
**/*.dmg
**/*.app
